{"name":"Treacherous Blizzard","hex":"#ddf5e7","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"treacherous","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Exhibiting treachery.","Deceitful; inclined to betray."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/treacherous"},{"term":"blizzard","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A large snowstorm accompanied by strong winds and greatly reduced visibility caused by blowing snow.","A large amount of paperwork."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To fall in windy conditions."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blizzard"}],"entries":[{"title":"Blizzard","blocks":[{"text":"A blizzard is a severe snowstorm characterized by strong sustained winds and low visibility, lasting for a prolonged period of time—typically at least three or four hours. A ground blizzard is a weather condition where snow that has already fallen is being blown by wind. Blizzards can have an immense size and usually stretch to hundreds or thousands of kilometres."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Blizzard3_-_NOAA.jpg/330px-Blizzard3_-_NOAA.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blizzard"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/Tochal_sport_complex_16.jpg/500px-Tochal_sport_complex_16.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ad/Tochal_sport_complex_16.jpg/500px-Tochal_sport_complex_16.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Blizzard at the Tochal Skiing resort, Tehran and affected skiers.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATochal_sport_complex_16.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Heavy_Blizzard_in_Ontario%2C_Canada.jpg/500px-Heavy_Blizzard_in_Ontario%2C_Canada.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia